{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \r\n\r\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0052696 flavonoid glucuronidation\r\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/28506\r\n(This term is about an MF)\r\n\r\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \r\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1u6xQnD0IpvP0cxF1j6ebkcuxVDqPG6GtwfvGMbutfRw/edit?gid=0#gid=0\r\n\r\nImpacted groups: \r\nBHF-UCL 5 -done\r\nRGD 1\r\n\r\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\r\n----\r\n\r\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \r\nNone\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks.\r\n", "created_at": "2024-12-06T23:50:54Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0052696 flavonoid glucuronidation", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2024-12-13T09:18:50Z"}
